Oriel was one of the two fey who held court in a glade deep in the [[Verdant Expanse]]. She played a harp, and the court's sing-song speech stopped when she did. She was tall and gangly with bluish-gray skin, a fused bone mask for a face, and gossamer wrappings. She wore a black raiment.

She spoke for the court less often than [[People/Jin|Jin]] did, but she opened the way to their Lady. She strummed a specific melody on her harp and a door marked with a crescent moon carved itself into a fallen tree trunk. When the investigators refused to enter and attacked, she fought with summoned thorns and with a laugh that spread to those who heard it. She was cut down in the glade.
